events:
    -
        name: 'VilniusPHP 0x95: Generated by AI!!'
        date: '2026-11-19'
        facebook: 'https://www.meetup.com/vilniusphp/events/317271644/'
        ligtingTalks: false
        masterTopic: >-
            We're excited to announce that VilniusPHP 0x95 will close the year in the new Ovoko office!
            Join the community to discuss new approaches, new ideas and close the year with drinks and food.
        speakers:
            -
                name: 'Tautvydas Karvelis @ Ovoko'
                title: 'TypeSafe AI and Jev in PHP'
                description: >-
                    An introduction to JEV AI from TypeSafe AI, exploring how it works, how to integrate it with PHP,
                    and its practical use cases, benefits, and limitations.
                    (Presented in English)
            -
                name: 'Robertas @ Boozt'
                title: 'From AI skeptic to promoter'
                description: >-
                    Checkout is one of the least forgiving places in e-commerce to experiment. So how do you put AI
                    to work in a business-critical system without compromising reliability or the customer experience?
                    In this talk, the Boozt team shares lessons from introducing AI into checkout, what it takes to
                    build trust in AI, and how they turned initial skepticism into enthusiasm.
                    (Presented in English)
